      "cooked": "<p>I just became aware of the following erratum — which is major enough to significantly affect practically all games of <em><strong>Spirit Island</strong></em> — and, even though it was added last year, I thought it was important enough that I should make sure y’all are aware of it.</p>\n<p>Here it is: <a href=\"https://querki.net/u/darker/spirit-island-faq/#!one-more-blight-errata\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">https://querki.net/u/darker/spirit-island-faq/#!one-more-blight-errata</a></p>\n<p>The main part of the erratum is this:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>During Setup, you get <strong>exactly 1</strong> additional Blight in your Blight pool.</p>\n</blockquote>",
